{"displayStem":"발열 환자 두 명에게서 항균제 투여 전에 서로 다른 말초 부위로 두 세트씩 채혈하였다. 각 세트는 두 배양병으로 구성되었다. 채혈량과 배양 조건은 적절하였다. 그래프에는 양성 병만 표시하였다.","notes":[{"kind":"provenance","text":"자료는 독립적으로 작성한 교육용 모의자료이다."}],"evidenceMarkup":["<div class=\"dataset-evidence \"><div class=\"evidence\"><div class=\"measurement-panels\"><figure class=\"measurement-panel\"><figcaption>혈액배양 양성 시각</figcaption><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 580 355\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"혈액배양 양성 시각。환자 (0:Ⅰ, 1:Ⅱ)、양성까지 시간 (h)\"><rect x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"580\" height=\"355\" fill=\"white\"></rect><line x1=\"76\" y1=\"45\" x2=\"76\" y2=\"229\" stroke=\"black\"></line><line x1=\"76\" y1=\"229\" x2=\"526\" y2=\"229\" stroke=\"black\"></line><text x=\"20\" y=\"25\">양성까지 시간 (h)</text><line x1=\"158.5\" y1=\"229\" x2=\"158.5\" y2=\"234\" stroke=\"black\"></line><text x=\"158.5\" y=\"255\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Ⅰ</text><line x1=\"433.5\" y1=\"229\" x2=\"433.5\" y2=\"234\" stroke=\"black\"></line><text x=\"433.5\" y=\"255\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Ⅱ</text><line x1=\"71\" y1=\"229\" x2=\"76\" y2=\"229\" stroke=\"black\"></line><text x=\"65\" y=\"234\" text-anchor=\"end\">0</text><line x1=\"71\" y1=\"185.5\" x2=\"76\" y2=\"185.5\" stroke=\"black\"></line><text x=\"65\" y=\"190.5\" text-anchor=\"end\">12</text><line x1=\"71\" y1=\"142\" x2=\"76\" y2=\"142\" stroke=\"black\"></line><text x=\"65\" y=\"147\" text-anchor=\"end\">24</text><line x1=\"71\" y1=\"98.5\" x2=\"76\" y2=\"98.5\" stroke=\"black\"></line><text x=\"65\" y=\"103.5\" text-anchor=\"end\">36</text><line x1=\"71\" y1=\"55\" x2=\"76\" y2=\"55\" stroke=\"black\"></line><text x=\"65\" y=\"60\" text-anchor=\"end\">48</text><circle cx=\"158.5\" cy=\"87.625\" r=\"3.2\" fill=\"white\" stroke=\"black\"></circle><circle cx=\"433.5\" cy=\"188.4\" r=\"3.2\" fill=\"white\" stroke=\"black\"></circle><circle cx=\"433.5\" cy=\"185.1375\" r=\"3.2\" fill=\"white\" stroke=\"black\"></circle><circle cx=\"433.5\" cy=\"189.85\" r=\"3.2\" fill=\"white\" stroke=\"black\"></circle><circle cx=\"433.5\" cy=\"186.5875\" r=\"3.2\" fill=\"white\" stroke=\"black\"></circle><circle cx=\"85\" cy=\"301\" r=\"3\" fill=\"white\" stroke=\"black\"></circle><text x=\"97\" y=\"306\">양성 병</text><text x=\"300\" y=\"282\" text-anchor=\"middle\">환자 (0:Ⅰ, 1:Ⅱ)</text></svg></figure></div></div></div>","<div class=\"dataset-evidence \"><div class=\"evidence\"><table><thead><tr><th>항목</th><th>Ⅰ</th><th>Ⅱ</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>양성 병 / 전체 병</td><td>1/4</td><td>4/4</td></tr><tr><td>분리 균</td><td>Staphylococcus epidermidis</td><td>Staphylococcus aureus</td></tr><tr><td>독립 세트에서 같은 균</td><td>한 세트만</td><td>두 세트 모두</td></tr><tr><td>임상</td><td>일시적 발열, 현재 안정</td><td>지속 발열과 오한</td></tr></tbody></table></div></div>"]}